# AI Translated
# Needs human review: upstream Preferences label for 'Stealth mode' is 'Unsichtbarer Modus', other messages use 'Stealth-Modus'; check consistency
#. TRN Shown by Help > Check for Updates while Stealth mode is on: the check never goes online then.
msgid ""
"Checking for updates is turned off while Stealth mode is on. Turn off "
"Stealth mode in Preferences to check for a new release."
msgstr ""
"Die Suche nach Updates ist ausgeschaltet, solange der Stealth-Modus aktiv "
"ist. Schalten Sie den Stealth-Modus in den Einstellungen aus, um nach einer "
"neuen Version zu suchen."
